Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:04.68,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:05.87,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:09.95,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,I think I want to fill a role\Nthat our group is lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.33,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:16.52,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,If I do that, we could all \Nhave fun being hunters...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.28,Flashback Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:24.49,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,I don't have a particularly strong body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:31.33,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Then maybe it'll be a good fit for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.56,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Becoming an alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:40.06,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The thing with Sitri's Slime is \Nthat the speed of its evolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:43.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,the ability to adapt to its environment, \Nhas been greatly improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.26,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But it's still a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:47.65,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.65,0:00:49.73,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:54.35,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I adjusted it so \Nit won't attack the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.69,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:57.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So you and I are safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:00:58.32,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:01.48,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Wait, only us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:05.07,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Even if it could get out of \Nthe metalium alloy capsule,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:08.83,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,it couldn't get out of this safe because \Nof the dimensional misalignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.83,0:01:11.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Uh, Sitri?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:16.19,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The slime got out of the capsule and \Nescaped when you opened the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:18.79,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Is that the right answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:19.75,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:23.67,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The room has no vents or pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.11,0:01:29.66,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Being a slime, it should still \Ninstinctively prefer high humidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.66,0:01:33.13,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And so it escaped through this drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:34.65,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Is that the right answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:37.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:40.76,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,So you're saying a slime that has the \Npower to destroy the entire capital
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:42.82,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,was oozing around this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:44.57,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I think I'm going to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:48.58,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please leave this matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:50.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:51.13,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:53.08,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And then, there's another matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:54.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Another matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:59.66,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,We are now in the golden age \Nof the treasure hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:02.93,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Amid the sparkling talent on \Ndisplay in the capital of Zebrudia,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:05.62,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,there was one man who stood \Nout amongst all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:08.10,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His name is Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.02,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The White Wolf's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:10.72,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:13.98,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is an epic tale \Nfull of glory and agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.08,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of how he became renowned \Nfor being the leader
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:18.98,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of the strongest party he founded \Nwith his childhood friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:22.56,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,and also the master of the strongest clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:25.18,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If we don't do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.61,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,the entire investigation team \Nwill likely be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:28.59,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:44.53,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,For ranged attacks, hunters \Nnaturally resort to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:47.50,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,But I deliberately chose the bow instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:50.50,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 07
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:50.50,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}The Akashic Tower Wants to Experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"The Akashic Tower Wants to Experiment."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:08.93,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.37,0:04:22.86,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Nothing in the White Wolf's Den \Ntreasure vault seems normal anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.44,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Elite hunters from Steps and \Nthe Association
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:28.44,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,have been dispatched in order\Nto conduct a large scale investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:34.09,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,In turn, the secret organization Akashic Tower \Nreadies itself to deal a decisive blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.39,0:04:38.58,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Is a brutal clash between the two \Nfactions inescapable fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:43.12,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,And then there's our Krai Andrey,\Nwho really doesn't want to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:47.38,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His ingenious scheme is to be \Nsteadfast in not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:49.00,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Is that really all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:54.59,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Good work, Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.51,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:56.57,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,How's it looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:59.77,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like anything's \Nhappening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:02.33,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Is anyone coming to take command?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:05.30,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I don't mind if people \Ndo their own thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:07.02,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,but we have so many of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:10.76,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Krai said to follow the \Ncommand of the Crosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.66,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Not surprised he isn't showing up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:15.98,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,but where's Liz?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.44,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I know she wanted to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:20.50,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Krai ended up commandeering her and Tino.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.50,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Looks like he's got a job\Nfor them somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:24.26,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:28.18,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Would've been impossible to coordinate \Nanything with Stifled Shadow around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.30,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.19,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:32.71,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Okay! Gather around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.30,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Let's talk strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:42.08,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Anyone here ever had a serious \Nbattle against slimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.07,Default,StepsHunter1,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:43.84,Default,StepsHunter2,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:44.92,Default,StepsHunter3,0,0,0,,Have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.57,Default,StepsHunter4,0,0,0,,Never done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:49.65,Default,EAHunter1,0,0,0,,Are they even something\Nyou can have a proper battle with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:52.33,Default,EAHunter2,0,0,0,,I've stepped on some and \Nsquashed them without noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:55.57,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Did anyone bring anything \Nuseful against slimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:57.54,Default,StepsHunter1,0,0,0,,Slimes are weak against slashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.11,Default,StepsHunter1,0,0,0,,My normal sword will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:01.55,Default,StepsHunter2,0,0,0,,They're also weak against blunt weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:03.08,Default,StepsHunter2,0,0,0,,I've got my hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:04.87,Default,StepsHunter3,0,0,0,,They're weak against magic, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:07.10,Default,StepsHunter3,0,0,0,,My magic flame can take \Nthem out in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:08.84,Default,EAHunter3,0,0,0,,Or my wind magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.36,Default,EAHunter4,0,0,0,,I've brought this anti-slime spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:14.35,Default,EAHunter4,0,0,0,,It was only 700 gil, so I \Nhave no idea if it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.61,Default,EAHunter6,0,0,0,,I'll crush them with my shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:18.15,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,I guess it's not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:21.94,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Even civilians see slimes \Nas harmless creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.29,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,So telling us to be wary\Nof them is a bit much...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:25.99,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.78,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Did he say anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:30.49,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Just that it's not a normal slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:32.03,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:36.08,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Why does he always have to be \Nso stingy with information?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.73,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It's always the same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.24,Top,Gein,0,0,0,,This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:41.97,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and get back to exploring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:45.44,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,If you're so afraid of the slime,\N we'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:48.12,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,If it even appears, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:49.02,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.02,0:06:50.13,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,He doesn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:51.12,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:53.38,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you looking at me like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:55.16,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:58.45,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Everybody thinks you'll \Nbe the first to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.45,0:06:59.47,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:00.88,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Just for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.43,0:07:03.72,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I tried to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:05.05,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:07.03,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Just don't die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:08.75,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Leave some clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.08,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,We'll avenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:13.29,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,You're all freaking crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:17.30,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Blindly believing the words of \Nsome guy who's not even here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:20.28,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:22.29,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Yes? A question?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:25.43,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,I'm an alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:26.68,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,My name is Talia Wydman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:28.39,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,An alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:31.80,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,I didn't know our clan had \Nan alchemist besides Sitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:36.27,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,I was with Sitri in the clan's laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:40.80,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,We were doing research on the \Npotential of slimes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.44,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Then do you know their weak points?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:49.57,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,This is a potion Sitri \Ncreated that kills slimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.67,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,It won't have an effect on anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:56.71,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,but if anything is related to them,\N it'll most likely kill it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:03.70,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:05.29,Internal,Sophia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.97,Internal,Sophia,0,0,0,,Your research is powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:12.44,Internal,Sophia,0,0,0,,With our preparations, \Nthere is no chance of failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:16.00,Internal,Sophia,0,0,0,,We're facing less than a hundred hunters,\Nand only a few even have second names.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.98,Internal,Sophia,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be a problem \Nto eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:21.62,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,How do you intend to make your first move?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:23.41,Internal,Sophia,0,0,0,,Right. First, I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:24.77,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:27.47,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,We'll start taking control of the interior in parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:29.73,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Be meticulously aware of everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:32.11,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,We'll use whistles to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:35.36,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,If there's an emergency, or if you \Ndiscover something, make a sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:38.47,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Everybody who's not assigned to \Nthe interior is on rescue duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:42.36,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Be on standby outside, and keep an \Neye on the surrounding area as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:46.64,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Give it everything you've got and charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:48.67,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Run roughshod over them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:50.20,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Leave your footsteps!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:54.32,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Let's all come back alive \Nand tell our dumbass master
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:58.22,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,that we eat these kinds \Nof trials for breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.14,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Only wolf knights, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:11.14,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to find nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:14.15,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,Only the already reported fact \Nthat the phantoms are stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.65,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Has Krai's insight become clouded?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.65,0:09:25.04,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,At this rate, if nothing happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.98,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It means that we were lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:32.54,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,If you hadn't given us useless orders, \Nthis would have been over hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:34.94,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Save your complaints for after.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.67,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,If you just got back stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:43.35,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,You better go pray to your precious master, \Nwho couldn't even bother to show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.64,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Hey. Don't go off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:46.67,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.06,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,I'm taking a leak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.08,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:56.09,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,I don't know Krai very well, \Nbut I know I trust you, Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:10:01.84,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Then I guess I better stay worthy \Nof that and pray to our master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.08,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.67,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,This is so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.01,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:15.25,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Didn't expect Obsidian Cross to be\N such a pack of spineless cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:17.76,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks, my ass. This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:20.03,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,If it were Ark Rodin, that'd be one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:24.25,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,but this guy's kicking back in the capital, \Npredicting what'll happen here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:26.13,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.77,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Was that a wolf knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:49.99,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,Is this really the right move?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:52.60,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,We're up against close to a hundred hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.60,0:10:54.58,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,That experiment freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.88,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,Just because she's our mentor's favorite...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.82,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,She can barely even use magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:03.52,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,"Whatever you do, don't fail,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:04.93,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.81,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,As if that needs to be said!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:10.23,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,Let's get this forced transmogrification\Nusing mana material over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:12.94,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:14.99,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:17.23,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,I'm a hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:29.92,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:36.20,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:37.68,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:41.67,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:43.72,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:47.36,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,Why... are you here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:49.13,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,Is Thousand Tricks behind this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:50.97,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,He's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:53.91,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,All of this is coming from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:59.86,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,I see. So Thousand Tricks isn't here, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:01.58,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.08,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.35,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,Do it, Hos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:08.20,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:33.61,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,The body of this phantom underwent \Na forced transmogrification.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:37.23,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,It will desire highly \Nconcentrated mana material.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:37.86,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.85,0:12:42.96,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,Now, between us and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:46.12,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,I wonder who has absorbed \Nmore mana material.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:49.58,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,This thing is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.07,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:58.22,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,That's the whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:12:59.76,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,You heard it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:01.69,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,That was one blow of the whistle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.00,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Everyone on alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:04.92,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Call everyone back out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:05.77,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It's outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:17.62,Internal,Sven(M),0,0,0,,What are we going to face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:21.26,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Gein?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:22.86,Default,Treble,0,0,0,,He hasn't come back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:23.64,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:34.55,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:36.43,Default,Treble,0,0,0,,Gein?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:38.35,Default,Treble,0,0,0,,You... Your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:40.80,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks was telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.04,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,It's a slime!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:02.70,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,A slime?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:06.18,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,I've never seen a slime like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:07.54,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Don't stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.94,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It's slow to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.46,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Mages, keep it contained!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:17.82,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,First, we stop it from advancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.05,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Henrik, help Gein!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:32.23,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:35.86,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Please let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.35,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:42.82,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,These weird guys injected \Nsomething into a wolf knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.33,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Then it turned into slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:47.23,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks' words were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:50.62,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:54.84,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:55.87,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,It's unscathed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.23,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Goddamn Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:15:00.11,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,How is {\i1}this{\i0} a slime?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:02.85,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:09.98,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:12.40,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,How are both physical and \Nmagical attacks ineffective?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.35,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:16.64,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Well, just escaping in \Nthe nick of time won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.78,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,We can't let this thing run loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:23.66,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Don't let it get close to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.50,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,If it attacks you, focus on evading!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:28.26,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Let's box it in! It's slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:30.10,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Put everything you've got into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:33.02,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Talia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:35.91,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:38.10,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,If it touches the liquid inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:41.25,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,the slime should self-destruct. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.01,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:43.03,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.90,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Hey, you! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.75,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,It jumped?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:51.56,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:55.12,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:58.82,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:10.16,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Die, freaking slime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:17.51,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:20.92,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I knew it wasn't really a slime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:23.30,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Screw you, Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:25.55,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:27.08,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:28.83,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.73,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Krai did say it was something slime-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.54,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Like{\i0}"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:38.13,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,He needs to quit thinking the Grievers are the \Nnorm when they can brute-force anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.13,0:16:41.50,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,How many times is he going\N to almost get us killed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:44.57,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It nullifies magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:47.31,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Huh? Nullifies magic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.32,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Sitri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.07,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:54.98,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai told me things were probably \Ngetting pretty bad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:57.21,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:17:00.95,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please believe in me and let me take charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:02.47,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:06.56,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Tremendous amounts of magic\Nswirl around its exterior,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:09.07,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,forming a powerful force field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:12.53,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's what's deflecting your arrows \Nand nullifying other magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:14.52,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I haven't seen a phantom \Nthis strong before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:17.22,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,not even in a level 8 treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:19.47,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It is extremely interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:23.47,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Its body is melting...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:29.58,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The mana material composing the phantom is \Nforcibly being changed into magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:31.20,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.79,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Hey, Sitri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:38.36,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's trying to replenish its melted body \Nby absorbing additional mana material?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.72,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Is that why it's trying to eat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:44.20,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,because I've absorbed more mana \Nmaterial than anyone else here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:46.74,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:50.01,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,This experiment is a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:51.69,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:52.49,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Fall back for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:56.51,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I appreciate the concern, Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.27,0:17:59.90,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:01.50,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:02.59,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:05.82,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:18.43,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What did you throw?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:20.07,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Anti-mana metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:21.95,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:23.80,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Branch Manager Gark?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:27.00,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:31.33,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,He gave me a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:34.43,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I can't run like my sister can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.83,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:37.81,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Let me give you a proper explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.81,0:18:43.32,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I have an idea about what this phenomenon \Nmight be and who's pulling the strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:47.58,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,She defeated the transmogrified\Nphantom that easily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.20,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Sitri Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:53.85,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,The one Sophia said was on our tail...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:58.35,Internal,Noctus,0,0,0,,She managed to understand the nature \Nof the transmogrification potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:00.86,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,The Akashic Tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:04.56,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,You're saying they're conducting research \Non how to control treasure vaults at will?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:05.63,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:10.07,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,Noctus Cochlear... The Master of Mages, \Nwas permanently banished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:11.64,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,There's no way he's in the empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:15.03,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting you to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:19.00,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's why I've been chasing after \Nthe Master of Mages by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:22.75,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,There are already anomalies \Noccurring in the treasure vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:26.91,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I assume the previous phantom was \Na by-product of their experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:29.15,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Uh, Sitri?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:30.38,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Talia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:33.91,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean they have some \Nsort of equipment underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:34.82,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:36.67,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:39.84,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,They would need large-scale \Nequipment to carry this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:42.91,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's the heart of his research.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:46.58,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Which means that they are \Nalready prepared for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,We'll interrogate the \Nmages that Gein captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:53.62,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I don't think this will be the only\Nmonster of that type we encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.96,Default,Mariet,0,0,0,,But if you have that stick\Nyou threw earlier—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.11,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:59.35,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That was all of my anti-mana metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:02.63,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I never imagined we'd face \Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:04.72,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Krai didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:05.79,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.79,0:20:08.15,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Damn him. Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.15,0:20:10.37,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:11.87,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'll do the analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:15.15,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be too difficult \Nwith this many hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:18.40,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm not Krai, but I'll give it my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.76,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I cannot fight at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:24.15,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,so please lend me your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:29.08,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,She's such a steadfast person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:30.16,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You mean Sitri?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:34.91,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,"I cannot fight at all"... \NI would never be able to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:37.93,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,She's pretty strong for being weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.93,0:20:38.55,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:40.53,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:42.46,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Don't get taken in by her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:44.11,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.11,0:20:45.92,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,She says she's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:49.31,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,So she thinks she can do \Nanything and get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:52.18,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Using whatever means necessary \Nis natural for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.09,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:59.01,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,she's just as much a monster \Nas every other Griever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:05.58,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Si could die \Nif she's all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:07.62,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,She's as weak as can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:10.66,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,and she said Killiam was under \Nmaintenance right now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:12.73,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm really worried about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:14.95,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,So, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:16.21,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.21,0:21:19.60,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,But {\i1}why{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:18.92,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Even Liz's request doesn't make him budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:21.13,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,With his iron will, he still refuses to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:22.72,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,I wanna go! I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.45,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Is that really all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:23.45,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,You had no screen time at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:26.70,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,I wanna go! I wanna go! I wanna go! \NI wanna go! I wanna go! I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:25.50,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Our Krai Andrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:27.92,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Please tune in again next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:28.73,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:28.73,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:59.07,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,Welcome to the White Wolf's Den!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:23:11.53,EpTitle,Txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(478.445,354.111)}From Obsidian Cross, live at the White Wolf's Den
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.07,0:23:00.01,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,You still got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.01,0:23:00.84,Top,All,0,0,0,,Obsidian Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.84,0:23:01.89,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,You still got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.89,0:23:02.71,Top,All,0,0,0,,Obsidian Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.71,0:23:03.52,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,Pick up your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:04.31,Top,All,0,0,0,,And stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.31,0:23:06.75,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,We're all going, we're all going. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:06.75,Top,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:07.28,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:07.60,Top,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:08.09,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.09,0:23:08.59,Top,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:09.94,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,Okay, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.94,0:23:11.13,Top,Sven,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:12.09,Top,All,0,0,0,,...{\i1}Retire{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.53,0:23:16.83,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 08
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.53,0:23:16.83,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Rush In When It's Over
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.09,0:23:13.76,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What happened to Krai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.88,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Rush In When It's Over."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:23.19,Internal,Sitri,0,0,0,,I discovered this when I was \Nstill called "The Prodigy."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:28.22,Flashback Internal,Sitri,0,0,0,,{\i0}The Nature of Mana Material and the \NPotential of Treasure Vaults{\i1}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:31.20,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,The author is the Master of Mages,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:33.08,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Noctus Cochlear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:38.33,Internal,Sitri,0,0,0,,At that stage, what was written there\Nwas little more than a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.33,0:23:43.70,Internal,Sitri,0,0,0,,Still, I instinctively knew that\Nit was something extremely dangerous—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.54,Internal,Sitri,0,0,0,,something that could potentially \Nencroach on the domain of gods.
